| VFP after Wimp_Poll: starts 50 short-lived UnixLib tasks and polls,
| checking the active VFP context each time Wimp_Poll returns. Run from
| the desktop (double-click). Result in an error box and in
| <Wimp$ScrapDir>.VFPPoll. Thumb build. With a second thread.
Set UST$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set VFPPoll$Child <UST$Dir>.VFPChild
WimpSlot -min 8000K
Run <UST$Dir>.vfppolltestt threads
